<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa sees 1996 profits below 1995.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa sees 1996 profits below 1995.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Lufthansa AG, which reported lower pre-tax profits for the first nine months of 1996, said on Thursday it also expected profits for the full year to be below last year's result.</p>
<p>&quot;At the moment we are expecting that the profit for 1996 as a whole will be less than last year,&quot; the airline said in a statement.</p>
<p>Lufthansa said its fourth-quarter earnings would continue to be burdened by &quot;persistently high fuel costs&quot; and by losses on its freight business.</p>
<p>It added, however, that it expected to close the final quarter with a profit after favourable traffic data in the quarter so far.</p>
</text>
